null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwie3Z36ydKWAxXEha8BHWJ8Kl0Q3IcHCIsBKAg",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026/3/10二訪\n這次湯頭調整為鹹一點。\n整個味道都提出來了。\n泡系柚子鹽很好吃😋\n——————————-\n老闆娘講話中氣十足。\n特盛搭配辣雞白湯。\n雞胸、板腱、梅花豬肉片口感鮮軟。\n松板豬只有2小片、沒什麼記憶點。\n湯頭微辣，味道偏淡。\n麵是硬麵，可免費加麵。\n值得ㄧ提的是溏心蛋熟度控制的非常好👏🏻\n下次回訪會選湯頭濃一點。\n\n—————-\n謝謝店家回覆～\n整體來說這碗麵的表現是好吃的哦😊\n只是下次湯頭會選濃一點😆",null,[0,34]]]],[null,1769502658000000,1769503304000000,"7 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfMWdXQU42bWwtQUtLZjV1TE9rLWRPUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfMWdXQU42bWwtQUtLZjV1TE9rLWRPURoSQ2dzSXlQVGh5d1lReFl2LVRB\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwie3Z36ydKWAxXEha8BHWJ8Kl0Q_2MIjAEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12644505509964609120/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4UW1GcmFITlNWVEZLWWxkV1MwNUhVVFJWUlUwMFQwVm9SRXhWUlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["親愛的顧客您好\n很抱歉讓您有這樣的感覺 🙇\u200d♀️\n我們的肉品是以秤重為準，不是以片數計算，但確實因為手工切肉，厚薄部位不同，會影響視覺感受。\n\n很